    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk. maybe the \"next scene\" is just me finally accepting that i can't fight it. sometimes it feels like the struggle itself is the problem. like, if the end is inevitable anyway, why spend every single day fighting a battle that biology has already won? wouldn't it be more peaceful to just... stop fighting?",
